---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';import PostCard from '../../components/PostCard.astro';import {posts} from '../../lib/snapshot';import {documentText,jsonForScript} from '../../lib/document';
const searchData=posts.map(p=>({id:p.id,text:`${p.title} ${p.excerpt} ${documentText(p.document)}`}));
---
<Layout title="所有文章"><section class="container page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE JOURNAL</span><h1>所有文章<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>一些记录，一些探索。一点一点积累。</p></section><section class="container section-bottom"><label class="search-box" id="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="article-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索标题或正文…" aria-label="搜索文章"/><kbd>/</kbd></label><p id="search-count" class="muted">共 {posts.length} 篇文章</p><div class="post-grid" id="article-list">{posts.map(post=><div data-post-id={post.id}><PostCard post={post}/></div>)}</div><div id="search-empty" class="empty-state" hidden={posts.length>0}><span class="empty-symbol">✎</span><h3>{posts.length?'没有找到相关记录':'第一篇文章，还在酝酿。'}</h3><p>换一个关键词，或稍后再来看看。</p></div></section><script type="application/json" id="search-data" set:html={jsonForScript(searchData)}/><script>const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#article-search')!;const data=JSON.parse(document.querySelector('#search-data')!.textContent!);input.addEventListener('input',()=>{const term=input.value.toLocaleLowerCase().trim();let count=0;document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-post-id]').forEach(el=>{const item=data.find((p:{id:string})=>p.id===el.dataset.postId);el.hidden=!item.text.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(term);if(!el.hidden)count++});document.querySelector('#search-count')!.textContent=`${term?'找到':'共'} ${count} 篇文章`;document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#search-empty')!.hidden=count>0});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='/'&&!(e.target instanceof HTMLInputElement)){e.preventDefault();input.focus()}});</script></Layout>
